USB: the i2c eUSB2 repeater PHY, the sm8450 QMP combo-PHY table (SuperSpeed
and DP), the UCSI PPM reset, the vendor SVID alt-mode entry and the DP
link-capacity fix.

Merged from: bring-up patches 0009, 0018-qmp-sm8450-usb3-dp-phy, 0026, 0029, 0030

